/E (Disciplinary Penalty Disqualification: When both athletes in a semifinal match are disqualified via disciplinary penalty, the other semifinal will count as the division final. The disqualified athletes shall not be proclaimed third-place athletes, leaving that position vacant.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [10]
>>
