/E (Technical Penalty Disqualification: When both athletes in a final match are disqualified via technical penalty, the athletes who lost the semifinals shall return to fight in the final. The winner of this new final will be declared first place, and the loser will take third place. The disqualified athletes shall be proclaimed second place.)
